  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1610.02 Certificate Content",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1610.02 Certificate Content. Each certificate issued pursuant to Env-Sw 1610.01 shall contain:\n\n(a) A unique certificate number;\n\n(b) The name of the certificate holder;\n\n(c) The expiration date of the certificate;\n\n(d) The operator’s status as a principal operator or assistant operator; and\n\n(e) The operator’s step designation.\n\nSource. #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1600.html"
